    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirement</strong> You have two Draconic Arms unarmed attacks, at least one of which has the finesse or agile trait.</p><hr><p><span>You are trained well in the art of fighting with your draconic armaments. When you take this feat, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.evAxFVUdmJhPL3UG]{Draconic Arms} feat again.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>You make three Strikes with your Draconic Arms; two of which must be made with an unarmed attack with the Finesse or Agile trait. Increase your multi-attack penalty normally.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span> If you have the Draichsar Breath feat, you automatically recharge your Draichsar Breath if any of your hits critically hit.</span></p>"
